# .env.example: a TEMPLATE for your server's settings. It is committed to git, so it must
# only ever contain placeholders, never a real key or password.
#
# 1. Copy it:   cp .env.example .env
# 2. Put real values in .env only (never in a chat, an issue, a commit or public/).
# 3. Restart `npm run dev` after every change to .env.
# 4. For the live site, add the same variables in Vercel -> Settings -> Environment
#    Variables, then redeploy.
#
# Only SECRETS that server code (api/, lib/) uses belong here. The browser can't read .env.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI feature (optional): any OpenAI-compatible provider. Run `npm run models` to list
# the model IDs your key can use. Current providers and base URLs are in the course tool
# handout: https://github.com/Boyu-Zhang-UOI/Vibe_Coding_101/blob/main/TOOLS.md
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
LLM_BASE_URL=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai/
LLM_API_KEY=paste-your-key-here
LLM_MODEL=paste-a-model-id-from-npm-run-models
# Example only (model names change; check `npm run models`): LLM_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash-lite

# Groq:        LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
# OpenRouter:  LLM_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1   (use a model ID ending in :free)
# Ollama:      LLM_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1       (your own computer only; LLM_API_KEY=ollama)

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Database (week 7): Supabase settings do NOT go here.
# The browser needs the Project URL and the publishable key, so they go in
# public/config.js (copy public/config.example.js). They are public by design and safe
# only with row-level security; see supabase/policies.sql and README.md.
# The Supabase SECRET key never goes in public/. You only need it if a server route
# uses it, and then it goes here, for example:
# SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=paste-your-secret-key-here
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
